WEBVTT

00:09:28.471 --> 00:09:31.276
"Wow, if it's me -- who cares
about this, obviously --

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.234
giving this talk --

00:09:33.258 --> 00:09:38.976
and during this talk, I can't even notice
that the men's hands are still raised,

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.976
and the women's hands are still raised,

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.178
how good are we

00:09:42.202 --> 00:09:44.906
as managers of our companies
and our organizations

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:47.455
at seeing that the men
are reaching for opportunities

00:09:47.479 --> 00:09:48.526
more than women?"

00:09:49.277 --> 00:09:51.667
We've got to get women
to sit at the table.

00:09:51.691 --> 00:09:52.692
(Cheers)

00:09:52.716 --> 00:09:55.924
(Applause)

00:09:55.948 --> 00:09:57.271
Message number two:

00:09:57.295 --> 00:09:59.182
Make your partner a real partner.

00:09:59.206 --> 00:10:02.397
I've become convinced that we've made
more progress in the workforce